Package: dux-lang
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: The Dux programming language compiler
 Dux is a statically typed, compiled programming language that targets
 LLVM IR and produces native binaries. It features a clean, expressive
 syntax with modern constructs including generics, closures, algebraic
 data types with exhaustive pattern matching, RAII-based resource
 management, and an async/await concurrency model built on lightweight
 coroutines.
 .
 This package contains the dux compiler binary, the duxrt runtime
 static library, the duxrt C headers, and the Dux standard library
 source files covering I/O, networking, threading, time, data structures,
 and system interfaces.
